                note: "2440-2450 mm to the dome's roof (en/ru.wikipedia; wikireading) — no cupola, so the roof is the apex; the instrument reads the armour skin's apex, and the commander's MK-4 periscope hood (cast) stands 6 cm over the 2.44 roof — the band holds the roof AND the hood, not a cupola.",
